      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is the intended (quite confusing) behaviour of OnPlayerRestored in PlayerObjects.\n\nYou'll want to be checking if the player provided isLocal and they own the object:\n\n```cs\n\npublic override void OnPlayerRestored(VRCPlayerApi player)\n\n{\n\n  if (!Utilities.IsValid(player) || !player.isLocal || !Networking.IsOwner(player, gameObject)\n\n    return;\n\n  // Local client is executing this with reference to local player.\n\n}\n\n```",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
